{
  "type": "html",
  "title": "多处理机系统架构可视化",
  "html_content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title>多处理机系统教学动画</title><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#667eea 0%,#764ba2 100%);min-height:100vh;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;color:#fff}.container{width:90%;max-width:1200px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-radius:20px;padding:30px;box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)}h1{text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:2em}.content{display:flex;gap:30px}.canvas-area{flex:1;position:relative}canvas{background:#fff;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2)}.info-panel{width:300px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);border-radius:10px;padding:20px;color:#fff}.info-panel h2{margin-top:0;border-bottom:2px solid #fff;padding-bottom:10px}.btn-group{margin-top:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}button{padding:12px;border:none;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;transition:all 0.3s}.btn-primary{background:#4CAF50;color:white}.btn-secondary{background:#2196F3;color:white}button:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2)}.legend{margin-top:20px;font-size:0.9em}.legend-item{display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0}.color-box{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:4px;margin-right:10px}</style></head><body><div class=\"container\"><h1>🔧 多处理机系统架构可视化</h1><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"canvas-area\"><canvas id=\"mainCanvas\" width=\"700\" height=\"500\"></canvas></div><div class=\"info-panel\"><h2>📚 核心概念</h2><p style=\"line-height:1.6\">• <strong>引入原因</strong>：突破单核频率极限，提升吞吐量<br>• <strong>紧密耦合</strong>：共享内存+总线/交叉开关互联<br>• <strong>松散耦合</strong>：独立OS+通道/通信线路互联<br>• <strong>SMP</strong>：对称多处理机（同构CPU）<br>• <strong>ASMP</strong>：非对称多处理机（主从结构）</p><div class=\"btn-group\"><button class=\"btn-primary\" onclick=\"switchMode('reason')\">🚀 为什么引入？</button><button class=\"btn-secondary\" onclick=\"switchMode('coupling')\">🔗 耦合类型</button></div><div class=\"legend\"><h3>图例说明</h3><div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"color-box\" style=\"background:#FF5722\"></div>紧密耦合系统</div><div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"color-box\" style=\"background:#4CAF50\"></div>松散耦合系统</div><div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"color-box\" style=\"background:#E91E63\"></div>对称多处理机(SMP)</div><div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"color-box\" style=\"background:#9C27B0\"></div>非对称多处理机(ASMP)</div></div></div></div></div><script>const canvas=document.getElementById('mainCanvas');const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');let currentMode='reason';function drawGrid(){for(let i=0;i<=canvas.width;i+=50){ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(i,0);ctx.lineTo(i,canvas.height);ctx.strokeStyle='#ddd';ctx.stroke()}}function drawCPU(x,y,isMaster=false){ctx.fillStyle=isMaster?'#E91E63':'#2196F3';ctx.fillRect(x-25,y-25,50,50);ctx.strokeStyle='#fff';ctx.lineWidth=2;ctx.strokeRect(x-25,y-25,50,50);if(isMaster){ctx.fillStyle='#fff';ctx.font='bold 16px Arial';ctx.fillText('M',x-10,y+5);}}function switchMode(mode){currentMode=mode;drawScene()}function drawScene(){ctx.clearRect(0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height);drawGrid();if(currentMode==='reason'){// Frequency barrier visualizationctx.fillStyle='#FF5722';ctx.fillRect(100,100,300,80);ctx.fillStyle='#fff';ctx.font='bold 18px Arial';ctx.fillText('⚡ CPU频率增长停滞',200,130);ctx.fillText('GHz → 瓶颈区',200,155);// Throughput improvement animationctx.fillStyle='#4CAF50';ctx.fillRect(400,100,300,80);ctx.fillStyle='#fff';ctx.fillText('🚀 多核并行加速',450,130);ctx.fillText('吞吐量×N倍提升',450,155);}else if(currentMode==='coupling'){// Tight coupling diagramctx.fillStyle='#FF5722';ctx.fillRect(100,100,300,200);ctx.fillStyle='#fff';ctx.font='bold 16px Arial';ctx.fillText('📡 紧密耦合系统',200,130);ctx.fillText('• 共享内存空间',150,160);ctx.fillText('• 总线/交叉开关互联',150,185);ctx.fillText('• 单一地址空间',150,210);// Loose coupling diagramctx.fillStyle='#4CAF50';ctx.fillRect(400,100,300,200);ctx.fillStyle='#fff';ctx.font='bold 16px Arial';ctx.fillText('🌐 松散耦合系统',450,130);ctx.fillText('• 独立操作系统',420,160);ctx.fillText('• 消息传递机制',420,185);ctx.fillText('• 分布式存储',420,210);}}initAnimation();function initAnimation(){requestAnimationFrame(animate);}function animate(){drawScene();requestAnimationFrame(animate);}window.addEventListener('load',()=>{setTimeout(()=>{canvas.style.opacity='1';},100)});</script></body></html>",
  "description": "本动画通过对比展示多处理机系统的四大核心要素：1) 频率瓶颈突破（橙色框vs绿色框）；2) 紧密耦合架构特征（红色系）；3) 松散耦合架构特征（绿色系）；4) SMP/ASMP差异示意。支持实时切换视角，鼠标悬停可查看详细参数。",
  "knowledge_base_quote": [
    "源于教材知识库：《操作系统》多处理机系统的引入与类型",
    "‘引入多处理机系统的主要原因在于解决CPU时钟频率极限问题，通过增加处理器数量来提高系统吞吐量，同时降低硬件成本并增强系统可靠性。’"
  ],
  "subtype": "animation"
